# Aurelio's backend settings. Copy this file to backend/.env and fill in what
# you need: only OPENROUTER_API_KEY is needed, and only by the chat and the
# analysis. backend/.env is ignored by git; this template is not, so never put
# a real key in it.

# OpenRouter, the gateway the chat and the analysis talk to. Get a key at
# https://openrouter.ai/keys, and put the real key only in backend/.env.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Optional: the model, as a slug from https://openrouter.ai/models
# (default if empty: anthropic/claude-opus-5.5)
OPENROUTER_MODEL=

# Optional: give each role of the analysis its own model. Different models
# bring different blind spots, which is the point of a panel; leaving these
# empty runs every role on OPENROUTER_MODEL, and the analysis still works
# because the asymmetry is in the context each role receives, not in the
# weights.
#   analyst: judges the portfolio blind (quantitative work)
#   confidant: knows the person, never sees the figures (reads people, words)
# Slugs checked in Oct 2026: anthropic/claude-opus-5.5 ($4/$20 per 1M tokens,
# 1M ctx), anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.6 ($3/$15, 1M ctx), openai/gpt-6.1-sol-pro
# ($2/$10, 1.05M ctx), qwen/qwen3.8-max-0902 ($2/$6), and the two Kimi models,
# priced by the provider OpenRouter picks: moonshotai/kimi-k3 ($0.24 to $4.50
# in, $5.50 to $22.50 out, 1M ctx), moonshotai/kimi-k2.6 ($0.45 to $1.09 in,
# $1.89 to $4.60 out, 262K ctx).
OPENROUTER_ANALYST_MODEL=
OPENROUTER_CONFIDANT_MODEL=

# Optional: the model the chat panel answers with when nothing is picked in its
# menu (falls back to OPENROUTER_MODEL). The default errs large, because a
# wrong number about your money costs more than a slow answer.
OPENROUTER_CHAT_MODEL=

# Optional: another SQLite database. Default: backend/data.db.
# ./start.ps1 -Demo and ./start.sh --demo point it at backend/demo.db for you.
# DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///path/to/another.db
